  "attribution_note": "Published regular-pentagon double lattice of Greg Kuperberg and W\u0142odzimierz Kuperberg (1990), reconstructed from the explicit half-length parallelogram in Yoav Kallus and W\u00f6den Kusner, arXiv:1509.02241, sections2.2,2.3,3.1. Full-height product extrusion preserves complete owners. PingYou Ltd supplies the finite marked whole-owner return and native certificate.",
